  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "flycast-arcade",
      "description": "Per-title BIOS sets for the Sega NAOMI / NAOMI 2 / Sammy Atomiswave arcade boards emulated by flycast. flycast resolves these with a single file_exists at \"<system dir>/dc/<name>.zip\" (falling back to \".7z\") \u2014 see shell/libretro/oslib.cpp findNaomiBios and the game_dir construction in shell/libretro/libretro.cpp.",
      "systems": [
        "com.provenance.naomi",
        "com.provenance.naomi2",
        "com.provenance.atomiswave"
      ],
      "source": "flycast core/hw/naomi/naomi_roms.cpp @ 92a10ba0f0a5ca0d1ec9498962002f4cdcc8e7f6 - transcribed from the `bios` field of the Game[] table. Titles are the table's `description` field. Games whose `bios` field is NULL fall back to flycast's default \"naomi\" BIOS and are deliberately NOT listed here (that is derived behaviour, not sourced data). MD5s and sizes are intentionally null: they are not present in naomi_roms.cpp and were not guessed.",
